    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Dickland: Tower Defense</i></strong> is Tower Defense in Lowpoly 3D graphics. The main feature of the game is black humor and a visual environment, namely the world of penises. Here you have to build the economy and various defensive towers to resist hordes of enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2394110/extras/b1535729ed2bfdb7b4dd83eb0a042105.avif?t=1683103172\" /></span><br><br>To do this, you can choose different strategies, such as abandoning the economy to quickly build defenses, building the entire map with simple but cheap towers, or building a few, but very strong and durable upgraded towers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2394110/extras/e81e4bbaa705002a3068762b28a15d30.avif?t=1683103172\" /></span><br><br>When the towers can't cope with the hordes of genitals, or some one bespectacled ass was able to slip, then you can use various elemental super-attacks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2394110/extras/8b09259c4e51e48835fb46592b571873.avif?t=1683103172\" /></span><br><br>In the game you will find many different levels, both in terms of construction and visuals, from steppes and glaciers to real hell! You'll also find yourself in a pleasant but sometimes tense atmosphere, with a cute soundtrack and surrounded by cocks of all shapes and sizes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2394110/extras/fb23e6a273ea425b8d15c384543c046b.avif?t=1683103172\" /></span><br><br>Good luck to you, prove to all the sagging and crooked that you are Alpha here!",
